{"id":"268eccbadca3e375","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/100_原始递归算术_PRA.md","title":"100 原始递归算术 PRA","display":"100_原始递归算术_PRA","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始递归函数符号\">1. 原始递归函数符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。函数符号集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRSym\">\\(PRSym\\)</span> 与元数函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar:PRSym\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar:PRSym\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小对象：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in PRSym\">\\(Z\\in PRSym\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(Z)=0\">\\(ar(Z)=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in PRSym\">\\(S\\in PRSym\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(S)=1\">\\(ar(S)=1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^n\\in PRSym\">\\(P_i^n\\in PRSym\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(P_i^n)=n\">\\(ar(P_i^n)=n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in PRSym\">\\(g\\in PRSym\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(g)=k\">\\(ar(g)=k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:i\\mapsto h_i\">\\(h:i\\mapsto h_i\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRSym\">\\(PRSym\\)</span> 的函数且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(h_i)=n\">\\(ar(h_i)=n\\)</span>，则显式携带输入元数的构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1})\\in PRSym\">\\(Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1})\\in PRSym\\)</span> 且元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 是唯一空函数，而下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 仍是构造子数据。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\\in PRSym\">\\(g,h\\in PRSym\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(g)=n\">\\(ar(g)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(h)=n+2\">\\(ar(h)=n+2\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rec(g,h)\\in PRSym\">\\(Rec(g,h)\\in PRSym\\)</span> 且元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>形式化地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n)\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小二元关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Z,0),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(S,1),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Z,0),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(S,1),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\\land i&lt;n\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(P_i^n,n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n&gt;0\\land i&lt;n\\Rightarrow \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(P_i^n,n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(g,k)\\land\nh:k\\to PRSym\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(h_i,n)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1}),n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(g,k)\\land\nh:k\\to PRSym\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(h_i,n)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1}),n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(g,n)\\land\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(h,n+2)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Rec(g,h),n+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(g,n)\\land\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(h,n+2)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(Rec(g,h),n+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PRSym=\\{f:\\exists n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n)\\},\n\\qquad\nar(f)=n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PRSym=\\{f:\\exists n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n)\\},\n\\qquad\nar(f)=n\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{Gen}_{PR}(f,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项与量词自由公式\">2. 项与量词自由公式</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_{PRA}\">\\(Tm_{PRA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_{PRA}\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in PRSym\">\\(f\\in PRSym\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(f)=n\">\\(ar(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"app(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_{PRA}\">\\(app(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义显示缩写</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero=app(Z,\\varnothing),\n\\qquad\nsucc(t)=app(S,\\tau_t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero=app(Z,\\varnothing),\n\\qquad\nsucc(t)=app(S,\\tau_t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_t:1\\to Tm_{PRA}\">\\(\\tau_t:1\\to Tm_{PRA}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_t(0)=t\">\\(\\tau_t(0)=t\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QF_{PRA}\">\\(QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(bot\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>没有量词构造子。</p>\n<p>否定不是原始构造子；定义显示缩写</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)=imp(A,bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)=imp(A,bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{PRA}:Tm_{PRA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{PRA}:QF_{PRA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^{PRA}:Tm_{PRA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{PRA}:QF_{PRA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{PRA}\">\\(FV_T^{PRA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV\">\\(FV\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F^{PRA}\">\\(FV_F^{PRA}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(app(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(app(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(and(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(and(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(or(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(or(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV(imp(A,B))=FV(A)\\cup FV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"app(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=app(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[app(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=app(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"bot[x:=s]=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[bot[x:=s]=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)[x:=s]=and(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[and(A,B)[x:=s]=and(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{PRA}:Tm_{PRA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PRA}\\to Tm_{PRA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{PRA}:Tm_{PRA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PRA}\\to Tm_{PRA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{PRA}:QF_{PRA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PRA}\\to QF_{PRA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{PRA}:QF_{PRA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PRA}\\to QF_{PRA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]=Sub_T^{PRA}(t,x,s)\">\\(t[x:=s]=Sub_T^{PRA}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]=Sub_F^{PRA}(A,x,s)\">\\(A[x:=s]=Sub_F^{PRA}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{PRA}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{PRA}\\)</span> 为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-定义方程\">4. 定义方程</h1>\n<p>数码定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar0=zero,\\qquad \\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar0=zero,\\qquad \\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in Tm_{PRA}\">\\(u,v\\in Tm_{PRA}\\)</span>，定义拼接元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\frown u:n+1\\to Tm_{PRA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau^\\frown u:n+1\\to Tm_{PRA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\tau^\\frown u)(i)=\\tau(i)\\ (i&lt;n),\\qquad\n(\\tau^\\frown u)(n)=u,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\tau^\\frown u)(i)=\\tau(i)\\ (i&lt;n),\\qquad\n(\\tau^\\frown u)(n)=u,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\tau^\\frown u^\\frown v)=(\\tau^\\frown u)^\\frown v\">\\((\\tau^\\frown u^\\frown v)=(\\tau^\\frown u)^\\frown v\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>零函数和后继函数定义方程为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_Z^{PRA}=\\{eq(app(Z,\\varnothing),zero)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_Z^{PRA}=\\{eq(app(Z,\\varnothing),zero)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_S^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(S,\\tau_t),succ(t)):t\\in Tm_{PRA},\\ \\tau_t:1\\to Tm_{PRA},\\ \\tau_t(0)=t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_S^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(S,\\tau_t),succ(t)):t\\in Tm_{PRA},\\ \\tau_t:1\\to Tm_{PRA},\\ \\tau_t(0)=t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>投影函数方程集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{init}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(P_i^n,\\tau),\\tau(i)):n&gt;0,i&lt;n,\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{init}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(P_i^n,\\tau),\\tau(i)):n&gt;0,i&lt;n,\\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>复合定义方程为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{comp}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1}),\\tau),\napp(g,i\\mapsto app(h_i,\\tau))):\nk,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g\\in PRSym,\\ h:k\\to PRSym,\\ ar(g)=k,\\\n(\\forall i&lt;k\\ ar(h_i)=n),\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{comp}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Comp_n(g;h_0,\\ldots,h_{k-1}),\\tau),\napp(g,i\\mapsto app(h_i,\\tau))):\nk,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g\\in PRSym,\\ h:k\\to PRSym,\\ ar(g)=k,\\\n(\\forall i&lt;k\\ ar(h_i)=n),\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始递归步方程为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{rec0}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown zero),app(g,\\tau)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g,h\\in PRSym,\\ ar(g)=n,\\ ar(h)=n+2,\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{rec0}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown zero),app(g,\\tau)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g,h\\in PRSym,\\ ar(g)=n,\\ ar(h)=n+2,\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{recS}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown succ(u)),\napp(h,\\tau^\\frown u^\\frown app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown u))):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g,h\\in PRSym,\\ ar(g)=n,\\ ar(h)=n+2,\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA},\\ u\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{recS}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown succ(u)),\napp(h,\\tau^\\frown u^\\frown app(Rec(g,h),\\tau^\\frown u))):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ g,h\\in PRSym,\\ ar(g)=n,\\ ar(h)=n+2,\\ \\tau:n\\to Tm_{PRA},\\ u\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-等词与命题公理\">5. 等词与命题公理</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{prop}^{PRA}\">\\(Ax_{prop}^{PRA}\\)</span> 是下列八个局部实例族的并；它们依次记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^{PRA},Ax_{\\to2}^{PRA},Ax_{\\wedge E}^{PRA},Ax_{\\wedge I}^{PRA},Ax_{\\vee I}^{PRA},Ax_{\\vee E}^{PRA},Ax_{\\bot}^{PRA},Ax_{\\mathsf{cl}}^{PRA}\">\\(Ax_{\\to1}^{PRA},Ax_{\\to2}^{PRA},Ax_{\\wedge E}^{PRA},Ax_{\\wedge I}^{PRA},Ax_{\\vee I}^{PRA},Ax_{\\vee E}^{PRA},Ax_{\\bot}^{PRA},Ax_{\\mathsf{cl}}^{PRA}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(and(A,B),A),\\ imp(and(A,B),B):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(and(A,B),A),\\ imp(and(A,B),B):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,imp(B,and(A,B))):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,imp(B,and(A,B))):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(A,or(A,B)),\\ imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(A,or(A,B)),\\ imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(bot,A):A\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(bot,A):A\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{prop}^{PRA}=Ax_{\\to1}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\wedge E}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\wedge I}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\vee I}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\vee E}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\bot}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\mathsf{cl}}^{PRA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{prop}^{PRA}=Ax_{\\to1}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\wedge E}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\wedge I}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\vee I}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\vee E}^{PRA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\bot}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{\\mathsf{cl}}^{PRA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_=^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):A\\in QF_{PRA},x\\in Var,t,u\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_=^{PRA}\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):A\\in QF_{PRA},x\\in Var,t,u\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-量词自由归纳规则\">6. 量词自由归纳规则</h1>\n<p>后继与零的分离公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{N}^{PRA}=\n\\{neg(eq(succ(t),zero)):t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(succ(s),succ(t)),eq(s,t)):s,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{N}^{PRA}=\n\\{neg(eq(succ(t),zero)):t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(eq(succ(s),succ(t)),eq(s,t)):s,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词自由归纳规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\n\\subseteq\n(QF_{PRA}\\times QF_{PRA})\\times QF_{PRA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\n\\subseteq\n(QF_{PRA}\\times QF_{PRA})\\times QF_{PRA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下式定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{((A[x:=zero],imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),A[x:=t]):\nA\\in QF_{PRA},x\\in Var,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\n=\n\\{((A[x:=zero],imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),A[x:=t]):\nA\\in QF_{PRA},x\\in Var,t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PRA}=Ax_Z^{PRA}\\cup Ax_S^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{init}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{comp}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{rec0}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{recS}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{prop}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_=^{PRA}\\cup Ax_N^{PRA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PRA}=Ax_Z^{PRA}\\cup Ax_S^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{init}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{comp}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{rec0}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{recS}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_{prop}^{PRA}\\cup Ax_=^{PRA}\\cup Ax_N^{PRA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>PRA 的目标差异由符号生成与量词自由归纳规则共同给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PRSym=\\langle Z,S,P_i^n,Comp_n,Rec\\rangle_{\\min},\n\\qquad\nRule_{Ind}^{PRA}\\subseteq(QF_{PRA}\\times QF_{PRA})\\times QF_{PRA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PRSym=\\langle Z,S,P_i^n,Comp_n,Rec\\rangle_{\\min},\n\\qquad\nRule_{Ind}^{PRA}\\subseteq(QF_{PRA}\\times QF_{PRA})\\times QF_{PRA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QF_{PRA}\">\\(QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 没有量词构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-规则与证明\">7. 规则与证明</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A[x:=zero]\\qquad A\\to A[x:=succ(var(x))]}{A[x:=t]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A[x:=zero]\\qquad A\\to A[x:=succ(var(x))]}{A[x:=t]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^{PRA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^{PRA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^{PRA}=\\{((A),B):A=B,\\ A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^{PRA}=\\{((A),B):A=B,\\ A,B\\in QF_{PRA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq QF_{PRA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq QF_{PRA}\\)</span> 出发的 PRA 证明是非空有限公式序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(A_i\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F^{PRA}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}FV_F^{PRA}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F^{PRA}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}FV_F^{PRA}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ol>\n<li>该行属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>该行属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PRA}\">\\(Ax_{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{PRA}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in QF_{PRA}\">\\(B\\in QF_{PRA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_{PRA}\">\\(t\\in Tm_{PRA}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B[x:=zero]\">\\(A_j=B[x:=zero]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=imp(B,B[x:=succ(var(x))])\">\\(A_k=imp(B,B[x:=succ(var(x))])\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin FV_F^{PRA}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin FV_F^{PRA}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_{Ind}^{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{PRA}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{PRA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Proof_{PRA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Proof_{PRA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq QF_{PRA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq QF_{PRA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上一节意义下的非空有限 PRA 证明，且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{PRA}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{PRA}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Proof_{PRA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(Proof_{PRA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义无假设定理集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_{PRA}=\\{A\\in QF_{PRA}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{PRA}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_{PRA}=\\{A\\in QF_{PRA}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{PRA}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PRA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nPRSym,\nar,\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR},\nTm_{PRA},\nQF_{PRA},\nFV_T^{PRA},\nFV_F^{PRA},\nSub_T^{PRA},\nSub_F^{PRA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PRA},\nAx_Z^{PRA},\nAx_S^{PRA},\nAx_{init}^{PRA},\nAx_{comp}^{PRA},\nAx_{rec0}^{PRA},\nAx_{recS}^{PRA},\nAx_{prop}^{PRA},\nAx_=^{PRA},\nAx_N^{PRA},\nAx_{PRA},\nRule_{Ind}^{PRA},\nRule_\\to^{PRA},\nRule_\\alpha^{PRA},\nProof_{PRA},\n\\vdash_{PRA},\nThm_{PRA}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PRA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nPRSym,\nar,\n\\operatorname{Gen}_{PR},\nTm_{PRA},\nQF_{PRA},\nFV_T^{PRA},\nFV_F^{PRA},\nSub_T^{PRA},\nSub_F^{PRA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PRA},\nAx_Z^{PRA},\nAx_S^{PRA},\nAx_{init}^{PRA},\nAx_{comp}^{PRA},\nAx_{rec0}^{PRA},\nAx_{recS}^{PRA},\nAx_{prop}^{PRA},\nAx_=^{PRA},\nAx_N^{PRA},\nAx_{PRA},\nRule_{Ind}^{PRA},\nRule_\\to^{PRA},\nRule_\\alpha^{PRA},\nProof_{PRA},\n\\vdash_{PRA},\nThm_{PRA}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含原始递归函数符号生成、定义方程、量词自由公式和量词自由归纳；不含语义载体、赋值、满足关系、有效性、语义后承、全称量词、一阶 PA 归纳公理或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始递归函数符号","text":"1. 原始递归函数符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与量词自由公式","text":"2. 项与量词自由公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-定义方程","text":"4. 定义方程","level":1},{"id":"5.-等词与命题公理","text":"5. 等词与命题公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-量词自由归纳规则","text":"6. 量词自由归纳规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-规则与证明","text":"7. 规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\l